    "Both use complete finite native0-200m positive signed integrals and core>10cm/s. Northern270degree westward and Algerian90degree eastward frames remain fixed through depth. Neither uses a positive surface gate,relative surface rule or thermal gate. Greatest integral wins;first southern native tie. Gate/support-edge winners remain unresolved without weaker interior replacement or post-result tuning. Sensitivities use their own qualifying seed at the same selected column.",
    "Northern Current targets partial southern-France/Gulf-of-Lion/northern-Catalan context,excluding Corsican feeders,upstream Ligurian basin,downstream40.6N bifurcation/branches and offshore eddies. Fresh Berta2018 primary text describes wind-driven rotation/weakening/fragmentation. Regional winter450m/summer250m and25-40km width scales are literature context,not paired2022 boundaries or physical annual limits. These are not duplicated Ligurian measurements.",
    "Algerian sections target partial0-8E eastward coastal/slope context,excluding Alboran gyres/transition,detached Algerian Eddies,downstream Sardinian branches and other Mediterranean currents. Fresh Taupier-Letage2003 text distinguishes parent meanders from developed eddies and path deflection/recirculation. Typical200m Atlantic-Water layer thickness,deep eddy extent,sampling limits and reference pressure are distinct;no pressure conversion or water-mass classification occurs. Historical ELISA/glider observations do not validate2022 axes.",
    "All stops,gates,0-200m and10cm/s selection are declared OSW diagnostics,not digitized axes,widths,uncertainty intervals or complete named-current extents. Global-grid coastal support and a narrow jet resolved by only a few cells can censor/confound maxima. Geographic directional maxima may be eddy/recirculation rather than attached current;no independent axis,attachment or water-mass validation is claimed.",
    "Full native0-5000m adjacent finite crossing brackets preserve upper/lower contours,statuses,last supported bounds and paired spans. Selection endpoints,source layer/reach scales,instrument ranges,eddy depth,reference pressure,bed and domain limits are not current bottoms. Never bridge sign/cutoff/missing gaps. Same-sign deep flow can connect;model span is not physical thickness. Quarterly probes are not seasonal means or annual envelopes.",
